{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本東京旅遊勝地澀谷近年飽受過度旅遊及萬聖節混亂困擾。</p><p>自2022年韓國首爾梨泰院發生154人死亡的萬聖節踩踏慘劇後，澀谷區政府大幅加強防範措施，今年更打出「再見惡劣的萬聖節」（Goodbye Bad Halloween）口號，呼籲民眾及遊客不要前往澀谷街頭慶祝，引起部分商家不滿。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:23:56.645214+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:33:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.986537+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.777561+00:00","content_hash":"4c46cfcad7b89c5d37c656b82d9596f1c871cbd0d5bdbdd983ed4417d4d0c01a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}